  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why This Happens Quietly",
      "char_file": "서류더미_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Insulin resistance usually",
        "causes no symptoms at all",
        "",
        "Cells in muscle, fat and liver",
        "stop answering insulin, so the",
        "pancreas has to push out more"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Driver 1: Belly Fat",
      "char_file": "흰빵_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "First is fat around the middle",
        "",
        "NHLBI flags a waist over",
        "40 inches in men or 35 in women",
        "as raised risk for type 2 diabetes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fix 1: A Modest 5 to 7%",
      "char_file": "흰빵_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "NIDDK points to losing",
        "5 to 7% of your starting weight",
        "",
        "On a 200-pound frame that is",
        "10 to 14 pounds — not a",
        "transformation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Driver 2: Sitting Still",
      "char_file": "서류더미_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Second is uninterrupted sitting",
        "",
        "Muscle only pulls glucose in",
        "when it works, and the benefit",
        "of a workout expires"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fix 2: 30 Minutes, 5 Days",
      "char_file": "서류더미_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "30 minutes of activity",
        "5 days a week, and stand up",
        "every 30 minutes of sitting",
        "",
        "Insulin action improves even",
        "without any weight loss"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Driver 3: Short Nights",
      "char_file": "베개_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Third is short sleep",
        "",
        "Across 482,502 people, diabetes",
        "risk was lowest at 7 to 8 hours",
        "and rose below seven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fix 3: Defend 7 Hours",
      "char_file": "베개_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Protect seven hours in bed",
        "",
        "In a 2024 trial, cutting sleep",
        "by 1.5 hours for six weeks",
        "raised insulin resistance",
        "without any change in body fat"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
